WEBVTT

00:10:26.816 --> 00:10:31.126
is possible despite the ever-accumulating mass of evidence

00:10:31.126 --> 00:10:34.287
to the contrary.

00:10:34.287 --> 00:10:36.659
I'm not convinced of this.

00:10:36.659 --> 00:10:38.783
I can hardly say I believe it.

00:10:38.783 --> 00:10:40.725
I can only have faith in it,

00:10:40.725 --> 00:10:44.743
commit myself, that is, to the idea of it,

00:10:44.743 --> 00:10:47.744
and I do this precisely because of the temptation

00:10:47.744 --> 00:10:49.744
to throw up my hands in resignation

00:10:49.744 --> 00:10:53.265
and retreat into silence.

00:10:53.265 --> 00:10:57.946
Because despair is self-fulfilling.

00:10:57.946 --> 00:11:00.266
If we call something impossible,